      "timestampEdited": null,
      "callEndedTimestamp": null,
      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "It seems like this project's goals may be similar to Chipalooza, just intended to be on a grander scale.  But the fact Chipalooza is also targeting this shuttle might mean some of the people with the required skills and free time to tackle these kind of problems are already busy.  And some of the building blocks that will hopefully come out of Chipalooza would probably be useful for some of these more advanced goals (if gigabit ethernet/PCIE is even possible - high speed USB might be a more achievable goal?)",
