          "timestamp": null,
          "description": "BIO is the I/O co-processor in the Baochip-1x. In this update, I’ll talk about the origins of the BIO, starting by working through a detailed study of the Raspberry Pi PIO as a reference before diving into the architecture of the BIO.",
